            <ArticleTitle>Therapeutic renal artery embolization to relieve metastasis-induced flank pain. Case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>619-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The beneficial effect of renal artery embolization on flank pain in a patient with terminal colon cancer is described. The indications for the procedure are discussed, including its use in similar cases for temporary improvement of the quality of life.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
